2}}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }(1\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)-0\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0))+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 1)-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi \\cdot 0)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{4}{\\pi }(-1-0)+\\frac{4}{{\\pi }^{2}}(0-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293226 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293227 13194139534527 true] [17592186293226 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534527 true] [17592186293226 1041 "field-1" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293226 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293227 13194139534527 true] [17592186293226 1110 #uuid "70ea796f-ca89-51c5-bda1-3399890e3624" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293227 1034 "\\frac{4}{\\pi}" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534527 true] [17592186293227 1111 #uuid "b176a504-ffd4-5abf-9500-adc45cebbe4e" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293228 1017 #edb/ref 17592186293229 13194139534527 true] [17592186293228 1089 "q-49677" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293228 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534527 true] [17592186293228 1100 "Evaluate the integral  ${\\int }_{0}^{1/2}x{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293228 1113 #uuid "1884b2b6-9a5b-50db-96f7-0391992e90ca" 13194139534527 true] [17592186293228 1145 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{2x} & ⇒ & v=\\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}-\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}x{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{2}(x{e}^{2x}){|}_{0}^{1/2}-\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{e}^{2x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\fr